    "plus_minus_definition": "Sample standard deviation (ddof=1) of pooled out-of-fold (OOF) ROC-AUC across the 10 random CV fold-assignment seeds (42..51). Quantifies CV split-randomization variability on the fixed finite dataset; NOT standard error of the mean and NOT generalization uncertainty to unseen data.",
