      "bootstrap_95ci_seed42": "Stratified percentile bootstrap (B=1,000, [2.5, 97.5] percentiles) on seed=42 OOF predictions.",
      "bootstrap_95ci_mean_oof": "Stratified percentile bootstrap (B=1,000, [2.5, 97.5] percentiles) on 10-seed averaged OOF probabilities per row.",
      "cluster_bootstrap_95ci_mean_oof": "Family-cluster stratified percentile bootstrap (B=1,000, resampling family_id clusters with replacement within class) on 10-seed averaged OOF probabilities.",
      "generalization_caveat": "OOF bootstrap CIs measure finite-sample score uncertainty conditional on the fixed training pool; they do NOT capture model-fitting variance or true out-of-sample generalization error to unseen distributions."
    },
