    "brand_detection_definition": "Unified schema.detect_brand_mentions + schema.mask_brands + schema.DEFAULT_KNOWN_BRANDS (Real BD + Pilot + Batch 1-4) + Batch 5 brand_registry.json, with NFC normalization, contact-masking before brand checks, and full Bengali (-য়/-য়/-য়ে/-ের/-এ/-এর/-ে/-তে/-কে/-র/-দের) and Banglish (-er/-e/-te/-ke/-r/-y/-ye/-der) inflection support."
